              "document_id": "DOC-006",
              "status": "ready",
              "role": "section",
              "reading_text": "3. External transmission\n\nConfidential customer information may be transmitted to an authorized external party only when there is a legitimate business purpose, the recipient is authorized, and an approved secure transfer mechanism or controlled platform is used.",
              "section_path": [
                "3. External transmission"
              ],
