              "document_id": "DOC-022",
              "status": "ready",
              "role": "section",
              "reading_text": "7. Records\n\nOnboarding evidence, approvals, risk assessments, performance cases, corrective actions, and termination decisions must be retained according to enterprise governance requirements.",
